      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCESS TILLEY (5) is yet to miss the placings here in an excellent record which boasts six wins and four placings. Below best last time at Angle Park (19.96) in a Grade 3/4, finishing a 2.75 lengths fifth. With a clean break looks hard to beat. CARRY ON CASEY (7) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 19.60 beating Destroying. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. One of the prime contenders. RHINESTONE (1) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fifth (20.21) at Angle Park. Solid record here winning two races. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and two minor placings from eight starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MINH JACK (3) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
